WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:00.913
Let me take a second.

00:00:00.913 --> 00:00:03.000
It's been a while since I
checked in with my good friend,

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.880
Andy Richter,

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:05.960
I'd like to see how he's doing.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.070
Hey Andy, how are you?

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:08.230
Hi, Conan.

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:10.050
You are Conan, right? (laughs)

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:10.920
Yes (laughs)

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.380
We haven't seen each
other in a million years.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.733
You rascal.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.560
No, I'm doing okay.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.393
I'm hanging in there.

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:19.700
It's just strange times.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.670
Yeah.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.320
Trying to find ways to stay busy.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.410
What about you?

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:24.310
Ah, same.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:26.610
Yeah, I mean, you know,

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:28.460
kids and dog and chores.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:29.293
But yeah,

00:00:29.293 --> 00:00:30.690
that's pretty much it.

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:31.920
You know, I was thinking
about the other day,

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.440
I know You're a baseball fan.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:34.310
You must be looking forward

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:36.820
to the season starting up
in a couple of weeks uh.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.530
I am a baseball fan,

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:42.570
specifically a fan of Korean baseball.

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:45.620
Their season started
months ago and I'm hooked.

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:46.453
You know Andy,

00:00:46.453 --> 00:00:48.810
I didn't know you'd gotten
into Korean baseball?

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:50.120
Oh, how could I not!

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.810
It's literally been the
only live sport being played

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:54.500
in the world for the last three months.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.610
Sure you have to stay up
till 2:30 in the morning

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:57.670
to watch the games,

00:00:57.670 --> 00:00:59.710
but it's worth it when
you've got heavy hitters

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:01.250
like Yang Eui-ji,

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:03.850
helping the NC Dinos dominate this year

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:06.930
or or Yong-chan pitching
six straight no-hitters

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:08.600
for the Samsung Lions.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:09.433
Of course,

00:01:09.433 --> 00:01:10.930
you can't talk about pitching without

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:15.170
Chang-mo Koo and his 0.51 ERA this season.

00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:17.380
He's a lefty too. Can you believe it?

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:18.440
That was incredible you know,

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:20.330
I can't believe you caught up this fast.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:23.420
Ooh not as fast to as Sim
Woo-jun's dealing bases

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:24.920
for the KT whiz.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:27.250
You know, the biggest problem I have

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:29.930
is that I don't have anyone
to talk about this stuff with.

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:31.810
I mean, especially all the controversy

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:33.640
with the Kiwoom Heroes.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:35.540
Oh, you mean their owner Lee Chang-suk

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:37.310
was convicted of embezzlement, right?

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:38.143
Yes.

00:01:38.143 --> 00:01:39.800
I mean, can you believe Yang Joon-hyuk

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:41.660
wants to return after all that.

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.850
Yeah with three DUIs on his record.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:45.800
That sounds like the
perfect fit for that guy.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:46.633
Well, Conan,

00:01:46.633 --> 00:01:49.160
I had no idea you were into The KBO too.

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.137
Oh yeah, I'm a huge Doosan Bears fan.

